obs The gfd1 adaptive encoder honestly chose 0 deltas + 24 keyframes -- a moving block AND a growing fill on every frame make a delta cost more than a whole frame -- so gfd1 (4651 bytes) is a hair larger than gfv1 (4627), reported not claimed (REDS #82). Same honest fallback text_marquee showed on panning.
